  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KR-Sardonyx-NPC33_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Well, if it isn't the righteous and honorable Spellbinder. Here to cause more trouble? Sorry. I know you didn't mean to.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Mantis_MerchantF_F_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KH2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ZeliciaSnoopingOne_KH2_03.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1283215,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KR-Sardonyx-NPC33_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "While Vazivika was greedily taking bribes, she wasn't focused on finding information on the Fifth Column. Now she'll be watching.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Mantis_MerchantF_F_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KH2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ZeliciaSnoopingOne_KH2_04.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1283215,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KR-Sardonyx-NPC33_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I relied on Vazivika being too distracted to pay me any mind. I smuggled weapons out of the Diabolica Garrison to my hunter-sisters.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Mantis_MerchantF_F_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KH2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ZeliciaSnoopingOne_KH2_05.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1283215,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KR-Sardonyx-NPC33_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "They say you're a friend. Prove it. Sneak in through the back and steal some weapons, then pass them to the people on this list.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Mantis_MerchantF_F_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KH2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ZeliciaSnoopingOne_KH2_06.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1283215,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Underway",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "KR-Sardonyx-NPC33_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Sneak into the Diabolica Garrison and steal some Umbra Legion Weapons. Then, distribute the Weapons to our friends on this list.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Mantis_MerchantF_F_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_KH2|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ZeliciaSnoopingOne_KH2_07.mp3",
